From a1a0ae4427225180ba453bee73667bc6df82f717 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: akhila-guruju <v-guakhila@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 21:23:30 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] skip stripped fixture tests

Azure Linux repackages the libarchive tarball without the pre-compressed
binary test fixtures (encrypted, password-protected, and corrupted/fuzz/crash
inputs). Tests referencing those removed .uu files would fail at "make check".
This patch adds an early `skipping(); return;` to each affected test.
Also deletes four .uu fixtures files added in CVEs.
